sequenceDiagram
  participant App
  participant Observer
  participant Extractor
  participant Validator
  participant MemoryRepo
  participant ProfileBuilder
  participant DB
  App->>Observer: enqueue interaction
  Observer->>Extractor: extract candidates
  Extractor-->>Observer: candidate list
  Observer->>Validator: validate and classify
  Validator-->>Observer: validated candidates
  Observer->>MemoryRepo: upsert memory and evidence
  MemoryRepo->>DB: transaction commit
  Observer->>ProfileBuilder: update profile
  ProfileBuilder->>DB: read latest profile
  ProfileBuilder->>DB: write next version
  DB-->>ProfileBuilder: committed version
